<Programs Use="Context">
<Program Use="Context" Name="Continuous">
<Routines Use="Context">
<Routine Use="Context" Name="Lad_099_Controllers" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent Use="Context">
<Rung Use="Target" Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[TESTE test_bits.1 - FC11 HOLD: liga o hold da malha de vazao FC11 quando a alimentacao esta cortada (COLUMN_STOP_FEED) ou a bomba B421506 P11 esta desligada no passo 115.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(test_bits.1)XIC(M_115_FORWARD_FLOW_PROD)[XIC(COLUMN_STOP_FEED) ,XIO(INLET_P11_S) ]OTE(FC11_HOLD);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[TESTE test_bits.1 - FC11 HOLD: memoriza a ultima saida boa da FC11 enquanto produz normal (P11 ligada e vazao acima de 100 hl/h).]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(test_bits.1)XIC(M_115_FORWARD_FLOW_PROD)XIO(FC11_HOLD)XIO(M_FC11_MAN)XIC(INLET_P11_S)GRT(INLET_FT11,100)MOV(FC11.OUT,FC11_OUT_MEM);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[TESTE test_bits.1 - FC11 HOLD: durante o hold, a saida manual da FC11 recebe a ultima saida boa (valvula FCV421501 fica parada na posicao de trabalho).]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(test_bits.1)XIC(FC11_HOLD)XIO(M_FC11_MAN)MOV(FC11_OUT_MEM,FC11.SO);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[TESTE test_bits.1 - FC11 HOLD: coloca a FC11 em manual durante o hold. A rung anterior OTE(FC11.SWM) zera o bit a cada scan, entao ao sair do hold a FC11 volta ao automatico sem tranco.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(test_bits.1)XIC(FC11_HOLD)OTL(FC11.SWM);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
